                                "sense_id": "2742a03a-4ebd-3cb7-8d41-adb966a12268",
                                "text": "“The Global Africa Project” at the Museum of Arts & Design tries to survey this pervasiveness, in terms of contemporary visual endeavors of all kinds: jewelry, fashion, architecture, basketry, ceramics, painting, utilitarian design."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
